I made new personal record today, got to XL 10 with Arc. I bought
gauntlets of power at dlvl 2 and got lucky in quick Gnomish Mine
sortie which yielded dwarwish mithril and mattock (+1 as shown in post
mortem dump). And by dlvl 3 I was at AC -1... quite a change. I
thought I am unstoppable, but at dlvl 9 or so I ran into rust monster,
that quickly got me down to AC 4. Then I had a trap door fall to dlvl
10, got out of there after battling swarms of monsters, many of them
seen for the first time. I got sleep and fire resistance, but poison
turned to be elusive -- even after many poison resistance conveying
monsters I still could not get it. Also floating eyes seemed to be
banished or something. At one point I got hit with invisible black
light in fairly dangerous situation, but luckily I had unicorn horn
already. Everything seemed fine and dandy and I was all set for
Sokoban, when I got another trap door fall. As I tried to get upstairs
again I ran into a leocrotta. I thought it's just another fodder
monster, but boy, I was wrong. When I realized that I should be
running for my life I was already finished. What a stupid death, I
think I had some options at hand to deal with it: c!oBlindness,
expensive camera and ?oTeleport.

